1248 0 obj
<<
/Title (Abstract  ConsentGuard is a purpose-based consent recording and withdrawal prototype for a synthetic fitness service \(FitNest\), built on MERN stack. It records purpose, notice version, grant and withdrawal for three data-sharing purposes.  A mock downstream API\(Partnerhub\)checks the live consent state on every request using short-lived signed tokens and a consent -version counter,so withdrawn or outdated consent is denied on the next request. A hash-chained audit trail and a 20-test suite provides verifiable technical evidence.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 765 0 R
/Next 1363 0 R
>>
endobj
