/Title (Consent must be tied to a specific purpose. The DPDP Act 2023 requires consent to be free, specific, informed and unambiguous \(s.6\) [1], and GDPR requires purpose limitation and withdrawal as easy as giving consent \(Art. 5\(1\)\(b\), 7\(3\)\) [3]. ConsentGuard records a separate consent for each of three purposes.)
